# Build context whitelist for test/linux/Dockerfile.
#
# BuildKit applies this file to the Dockerfile it sits next to, so the global
# context rules stay untouched. The image needs exactly three files: the two
# lockfile inputs and the entrypoint. Everything else - .git, the host's
# node_modules, local artifacts, logs, .pi config, credentials, and any secret
# variant someone left under test/linux - must never reach the builder.
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!test
!test/linux
!test/linux/entrypoint.sh
